`diff`:
```rust
pub const GIT_TIMEOUT_MS: u64 = 30_000;
pub struct ChangeSet { changed: Vec<String>, removed: Vec<String>, unmatched: Vec<UnmatchedChange>,
                       entries: Vec<ChangeEntry>, degraded: bool }
